  "summary": "sssd vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that SSSD did not properly handle raw bytes in the PAM\npasskey responder. A local attacker could possibly use this issue to cause\nthe SSSD PAM responder to crash, resulting in a denial of service.",
